#: app/templates/settings_ai.html:341
msgid ""
"Colophon works against a local copy of your library to protect the "
"original files during metadata processing. When you are happy with the "
"changes you sync them back to the upstream library. If you do not have a "
"separate upstream library you can leave this empty — Colophon then works "
"directly against its book folder."
msgstr ""
