msgid ""
"Structured series + number (the index Hardcover lacks) for notable works."
" Runs only when the series or its number is still missing."
msgstr ""
"Strukturerad serie + nummer (indexet Hardcover saknar) för kända verk. "
"Körs bara när serien eller dess nummer fortfarande saknas."

