msgstr ""
"Frågar Goodreads, Fantastic Fiction med flera via fetch-ebook-metadata. "
"Långsam delprocess – styrs av sökdjupet ovan."

#: app/templates/settings_api.html:717 app/templates/settings_api.html:736
#: app/templates/settings_api.html:809 app/templates/settings_api.html:828
msgid "No key required"
msgstr "Ingen nyckel krävs"

#: app/templates/settings_api.html:720
msgid ""
"Fetches book covers directly via ISBN from the Internet Archive's open "
"library. Works best for books that already have an ISBN filled in. "
"Completely free, no configuration."
msgstr ""
"Hämtar bokomslag direkt via ISBN från Internet Archives öppna bibliotek. "
"Fungerar bäst för böcker som redan har ISBN ifyllt. Helt gratis, ingen "
"konfiguration."

